s=A.d("I'm a practising paediatrician and neonatologist. Day to day on the wards I kept reaching for the same handful of things \u2014 weight-based drug doses, growth charts, jaundice curves, lab ranges, quick reference to the latest guidelines \u2014 and every time I was fishing them out of a different app, a textbook, a photocopy, or a saved PDF on my phone.",l,l,l,l,A.r().$3$color$fontSize$height(p,14,1.65),l,l,l)
