B.b_X=new A.b("Child and adolescent: conversion from tacrolimus with stable graft function for a minimum of 3 months after transplantation (use of oral solution is preferred; tablet and oral solution dosage forms are NOT bioequivalent; see remarks): 5 mg/m\xb2/dose PO x 1, followed by 3 mg/m\xb2/24 hr PO \xf7 Q12 hr on the next day. Adjust dose to achieve desired trough blood level.",!1)
