B.cUG=s(["Red flags requiring investigation: weight loss, GI bleeding, persistent vomiting, nocturnal pain waking the child, fever, arthritis, family history of IBD.",u.q],t.s)
B.cUS=s(["Risk group also depends on age, MYCN amplification, histology, ploidy and 11q aberration.","Source: Monclair T et al. The International Neuroblastoma Risk Group (INRG) staging system. J Clin Oncol 2009;27:298\u2013303."],t.s)
