B.blh=new A.b("PO or ODT tabs: Start with 2.5 mg PO \xd7 1. If needed in 2 hr, a second dose may be administered. Dose may be increased to a maximum single dose of 5 mg if needed. Max. daily dose: 10 mg/24 hr",!1)
