B.bg5=new A.b("Infant and child: Load with 0.05 mg/kg IV \xd7 1; if no response, may repeat dose. Some recommend initiating a continuous IV infusion of 0.05\u20130.1 mg/kg/hr at the time of the responsive dose.",!1)
B.b9I=new A.b("Adolescent: Loading dose of 5\u201310 mg IV \xd7 1, followed by a continuous IV infusion of 1\u20135 mg/hr",!1)
