B.deG=s(["Strong inducer (e.g., carbamazepine, phenytoin, rifampin, St. John\u2019s wort)","Guanfacine may be titrated up to double the recommended target dose","Consider increasing guanfacine dose up to double the recommended target dose over 1\u20132 wk as tolerated. If the strong inducer is discontinued, decrease guanfacine dose to target dose over 1\u20132 wk."],t.s)
