B.dQN=s(["Strong inhibitor (e.g., clarithromycin, azole antifungals)","Decrease guanfacine dose to 50% of recommended target dose","Decrease guanfacine dose to 50% of recommended target dose. If the strong inhibitor is discontinued, increase guanficine dose to recommended target dose."],t.s)
