B.bbK=new A.b("Continuous infusion: 20\u201350 mCg/kg/min IV/IO (do not exceed 20 mCg/kg/min for patients with shock, CHF, hepatic disease, or cardiac arrest); see inside cover for infusion preparation. Administer a 1-mg/kg bolus when infusion is initiated if bolus has not been given within previous 15 min.",!1)
