B.dpx=s(["Cream: Lidocaine 2.5% + prilocaine 2.5% (5, 30 g)","Periodontal gel (Oraqix): Lidocaine 2.5% + prilocaine 2.5% (1.7 g in dental cartridges; 20s)"],t.s)
