B.dCX=s(["Provides sustained levels for 2\u20134 wk. Use with caution in renal failure, asthma, glucose-6-phosphate dehydrogenase deficiency (risk for methemoglobinemia), and cephalosporin hypersensitivity. Side effects and drug interactions same as for Penicillin G Preparations\u2013Aqueous Potassium and Sodium. Injection site reactions are common. Severe cutaneous reactions (e.g., Stevens-Johnson syndrome, toxic epidermal necrolysis, and drug rash with eosinophilia and systemic symptoms) have been reported.",u.ec],t.s)
