B.aSX=new A.b("Head lice: Saturate hair and scalp and apply behind the ears and at the base of the neck with 1% cream rinse/lotion after shampooing, rinsing, and towel drying hair. Leave on for 10 min, then rinse. May repeat in 7 days. May be used for lice in other areas of the body (e.g., pubic lice) in same fashion. If the 1% cream rinse is resistant, the 5% cream may be used after shampooing, rinsing, and towel drying hair. Leave on for 8\u201314 hr overnight under a shower cap; then rinse off. May repeat in 7 days.",!1)
