B.dBD=s(["Otic solution or suspension: Polymyxin B sulfate 10,000 U/mL, neomycin sulfate 5 mg/mL (3.5 mg/mL neomycin base), hydrocortisone 10 mg/mL (10 mL); some preparations may contain thimerosol and metabisulfite","For ophthalmic suspension, see Neomycin/Polymyxin B Ophthalmic Products."],t.s)
