B.aPe=new A.b("IM (use when IV route not feasible):",!0)
B.aEZ=new A.b("<40 kg: 15 mg/kg/dose IM \xd7 1. May repeat Q15 min PRN up to a max. total dose of 45 mg/kg for mild symptoms; may repeat twice in rapid succession for severe symptoms (max. total dose of 45 mg/kg). For persistent symptoms, may repeat another maximum 45 mg/kg series (in 3 divided doses) approximately 1 hr after the last injection.",!1)
B.b8R=new A.b("\u226540 kg: 600 mg IM \xd7 1. May repeat Q15 min PRN up to a max. total dose of 1800 mg for mild symptoms; may repeat twice in rapid succession for severe symptoms (max. total dose of 1800 mg). For persistent symptoms, may repeat another max. 1800 mg series (in 3 divided doses) approximately 1 hr after the last injection.",!1)
