B.atF=new A.b("Oral: 0.2 mg at bedtime; if needed, titrate to achieve desired effect by 0.2 mg Q3 days up to a max. dose of 0.6 mg/24 hr. Limit fluid intake to a minimum from 1 hr prior to desmopressin dosing until the next morning or at least 8 hr after dose administration.",!1)
