B.eco=s(["Injection (Precedex and generics): 200 mCg/2 mL (2 mL); preservative free","Multidose injection: 400 mCg/4 mL (4 mL), 1000 mCg/10 mL (10 mL); contains methyl- and propylparabens","Premixed injection in NS (Precedex and generics): 80 mCg/20 mL (20 mL), 200 mCg/50 mL (50 mL), 400 mCg/100 mL (100 mL), 1000 mCg/250 mL (250 mL); preservative free","Sublingual film:","Igalmi: 120, 180 mCg (10s); contains FD&C Blue #1 colorant, peppermint oil, and polyethylene oxide"],t.s)
