B.bhr=new A.b("IM: 1\u20134.5 mCg/kg/dose \xd7 1 was administered to children for sedation for EEG. Extremely anxious, inconsolable, aggressive, and noncompliant children received doses >2.5 mCg/kg, and calm and relatively compliant children received doses \u22642.5 mCg/kg. A second lower repeat dose (\u223c2 mCg/kg/dose) was administered when adequate sedation was not achieved after 10 min of the first dose.",!1)
