B.dpO=s(["Tabs, immediate release:","Zenzedi and generics: 2.5, 5, 7.5, 10, 15, 20, 30 mg","Sustained-release caps:","Generics: 5, 10, 15 mg","Dexedrine: 10 mg","Oral solution (ProCentra and generics): 1 mg/mL (473 mL); may contain benzoic acid and saccharin","Transdermal patch (Xelstrym): 4.5 mg/9 hr (4.76 cm\xb2 patch), 9 mg/9 hr (9.52 cm\xb2 patch), 13.5 mg/9 hr (14.29 cm\xb2 patch), and 18 mg/9 hr (19.02 cm\xb2 patch) (30s)","In combination with amphetamine (Adderall): Available as 1:1:1:1 mixture of dextroamphetamine sulfate, dextroamphetamine saccharate, amphetamine aspartate, and amphetamine sulfate salts (e.g., 5-mg tablet contains 1.25 mg dextroamphetamine sulfate, 1.25 mg dextroamphetamine saccharate, 1.25 mg amphetamine aspartate, and 1.25 mg amphetamine sulfate; 5 mg of the mixture is equivalent to 3.1 mg amphetamine base):","Tabs (Adderall and generics): 5, 7.5, 10, 12.5, 15, 20, 30 mg","Caps, extended release:","Adderal XR: 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, 30 mg","Mydayis: 12.5, 25, 37.5, 50 mg","Generics: 5, 10, 12.5, 15, 20, 25, 30, 37.5, 50 mg","Oral suspension: 1 mg/mL"],t.s)
