B.e4I=s(["Caps (Marinol and generics): 2.5, 5, 10 mg; may contain sesame oil","Oral solution (Syndros): 5 mg/mL (30 mL); contains alcohol (50% w/w), parabens, and polyethylene glycol"],t.s)
