B.dY4=s(["Use with caution in renal and hepatic impairment; 75% of metabolites are excreted renally, and drug is extensively metabolized in the liver. Side effects include hypotension, tachycardia, extrapyramidal side effects such as dystonia, feeling of motor restlessness, laryngospasm, and bronchospasm. May lower seizure threshold. Fatal arrhythmias and Q\u2013T interval prolongation have been associated with use.","Onset in 3\u201310 min. Peak effects within 10\u201330 min. Duration of action 2\u20134 hr. Often given as adjunct to other agents."],t.s)
