B.bb7=new A.b("Adult: Start with 1334 mg PO with each meal. Dosage may be increased gradually every 2\u20133 wk to bring serum phosphorus levels below 6 mg/dL, as long as hypercalcemia does not occur. Most patients require 2001\u20132668 mg PO with each meal.",!1)
