B.dHG=s(["Oral solution: 100 mg/mL (60, 100 mL); contains ethanol and sesame oil and supplied with 1 mL and 5 mL oral-dispensing syringes"],t.s)
B.biF=new A.b("Child \u22652 yr and adult: Start at 2.5 mg/kg/dose PO BID \xd7 1 wk; dosage may be increased to a maintenance dose of 5 mg/kg/dose PO BID. Dose may be further increased after 1 wk if needed and tolerated at weekly increments of 2.5 mg/kg/dose BID (5 mg/kg/24 hr) up to the max. of 20 mg/kg/24 hr. Those requiring a more rapid titration from 10 mg/kg/24 hr to 20 mg/kg/24 hr may be titrated no more frequently than Q48 hr.",!1)
