B.bbj=new A.b("Immediate-release dosage forms: Start at 6.25 mg PO BID; dose may be doubled every 1\u20132 wk up to a maximum of 25 mg PO BID.",!1)
B.aWf=new A.b("Extended-release capsules: Start at 20 mg PO once daily \xd7 1\u20132 wk; if needed and tolerated, increase to 40 mg PO once daily. If needed, dose may be further increased in 2-wk intervals up to a maximum of 80 mg/24 hr.",!1)
