B.axG=new A.b("2\u201316 yr: Start at 5 mg PO once daily; if needed and tolerated, slowly increase dosage at 5- to 7-day intervals up to the maximum of 40 mg/24 hr. Usual dosage range: 10\u201320 mg/24 hr or 0.3\u20131 mg/kg/24 hr \xf7 BID",!1)
