B.aQK=new A.b("Start at 15 mg/kg/24 hr PO \xf7 TID\u2013QID; increase dosage by 15 mg/kg/24 hr at weekly intervals up to a max. dose of 45 mg/kg/24 hr or 3600 mg/24 hr (whichever is less). See remarks for adjusting concurrent anticonvulsants.",!1)
