B.dKw=s([B.bAB,B.btl],t.T)
B.ddN=s(["Nasal burning and stinging is common. Nasal congestion, sneezing, epistaxis, watery eyes, sore throat, nausea/vomiting, and headaches may also occur. May cause a reduction in growth velocity. Nasal septal perforations have been reported. Flunisolide is a minor substrate of cytochrome P-450 3A4.","Shake nasal solution well before use and clear nasal passages before use. Priming of the nasal spray is recommended when using a new bottle or if the bottle has not been used for \u22655 days."],t.s)
