B.dxu=s(["Contraindicated in areas where drinking water fluoridation is >0.7 ppm. Acute overdose: GI distress, salivation, CNS irritability, tetany, seizures, hypocalcemia, hypoglycemia, and cardiorespiratory failure. Chronic excess use may result in mottled teeth or bone changes.","Take with food, but not milk, to minimize GI upset. The doses have been decreased owing to concerns over dental fluorosis."],t.s)
B.bWc=new A.R("FLUORIDE","Fluoritab, many others, and generics","Mineral",B.dwq,B.dTC,B.dxu,"","Harriet Lane Handbook, 24th ed. \u2014 pp. 1003\u20131004")
B.dMe=s(["Oral solution: 20 mg/5 mL (120 mL); may contain alcohol","Caps: 10, 20, 40 mg","Delayed-release caps: 90 mg","Tabs: 10, 20, 60 mg"],t.s)
