B.bkg=new A.b("Higher-weight child and adolescent: Start at 10 mg PO once daily and increase dose to 20 mg/24 hr after 2 wk. May further increase dose after several weeks. Usual dose range: 20\u201360 mg/24 hr; higher dose of 80 mg/24 hr has been reported.",!1)
