B.dOy=s(["Contraindicated with hypersensitivity to milk proteins. See Fluticasone Preparations and Salmeterol for remarks. Titrate to the lowest effective strength after asthma is adequately controlled.","DO NOT USE a spacer or volume holding chamber with breath-activated dosage forms. Specific breath-activated dosage forms require the following minimum inspiratory flow rates for proper dose activation:","Advair Diskus: 60 L/min","AirDuo RespiClick: 30 L/min","Proper patient education, including dosage administration technique, is essential; see patient package insert for detailed instructions for specific dosage form. Rinse mouth after each use."],t.s)
