B.be_=new A.b("Neonate: Bioavailability by this route is poor; doses of 1\u20133 mg/kg/dose once daily\u2013BID have been used.",!1)
B.b9R=new A.b("Infant and child: Start at 2 mg/kg/dose; may increase by 1\u20132 mg/kg/dose no sooner than 6\u20138 hr following the previous dose. Max. dose: 6 mg/kg/dose. Dosages have ranged from 1\u20136 mg/kg/dose Q12\u201324 hr.",!1)
