B.dhV=s(["The average embryo at 8 weeks is 0.6 inches (1.6 cm) long.","The embryo is about the size of a bean. The fingers and toes are developing.","The adrenal glands begin DHEA-S secretion and the testes begin to secrete testosterone.","In a process called physiological gut herniation, the intestine elongates and moves outside the abdomen into the base of the umbilical cord and rotates counter-clockwise at about 8 weeks. The intestine returns into the fetal abdomen by about 12 weeks."],t.s)
