B.e5V=s(["The embryo's tail has disappeared and it is now called a fetus. Fingerprints are being formed, and bone cells are replacing cartilage.","The adrenal glands are starting to produce catecholamines and the pituitary is starting to release ADH and oxytocin.","The fetus can make IgM.","The average fetus at 10 weeks is 1.22 inches (3.1 cm) long and weighs about 1.2 ounces (35 grams)."],t.s)
B.fao=new A.fx("10","WEEK 10 \u2014 Fetal age 8 weeks \u2014 2.3 months",1,"~3.1 cm (1.22 inches), ~35 grams",B.e5V,B.ex)
