B.bax=new A.b("Dosage regimens ranging from lower dosages (0.01 mg/kg/hr) to higher dosages (0.1\u20130.6 mg/kg/hr) have been reported (Chest 2008;133:887\u2013968S). The length of continuous infusion is variable as patients may respond to longer or shorter courses of therapy.",!1)
