B.b8f=new A.b("5\u201315 mg in 100 mL sterile water for irrigation at 100\u2013300 mL/24 hr. Instill solution into bladder, clamp catheter for 1\u20132 hr, then drain; repeat TID\u2013QID for 2\u20135 days.",!1)
