B.d2x=s(["Injection (vials): 0.4, 1 mg/mL","Injection (prefilled syringe): 0.25 mg/5 mL, 0.5 mg/5 mL, 1 mg/10 mL","Ophthalmic Dosage Forms:","Ointment: 1% (3.5 g)","Solution (previously available as Isopto Atropine): 1% (2, 5, 10 mL); may contain benzalkonium chloride"],t.s)
