B.bgB=new A.b("PO: Initial dose at 0.5 mg/24 hr \xf7 BID\u2013TID. If necessary, increase daily dosage by 0.25\u20130.5 mg/24 hr Q5\u20137 days PRN. Benefits are not to be expected for doses beyond 6 mg/24 hr. Usual maintenance doses for specific indications include the following:",!1)
