B.atb=new A.b("For treatment of malaria, consult with ID specialist or see the latest edition of the AAP Red Book.",!1)
B.b1c=new A.b("Child: 10 mg/kg/dose (max. dose: 620 mg) PO \xd7 1, followed by 5 mg/kg/dose (max. dose: 310 mg) 6 hr later, then 5 mg/kg/dose (max. dose: 310 mg) PO Q24 hr \xd7 2 doses, starting 24 hr after the first dose",!1)
