B.cJk=s(["Contraindicated in prolonged Q\u2013T interval. May potentiate barbiturates, meperidine, and other CNS depressants. Use with caution with concomitant use of other medications known to prolong the Q\u2013T interval. May cause dry mouth, drowsiness, tremor, convulsions, blurred vision, and hypotension. May cause pain at injection site. Fixed drug eruptions have been reported with use of the oral dosage form.","Increase dosage interval to Q24 hr or longer in the presence of liver disease (e.g., primary biliary cirrhosis).","Onset of action within 15\u201330 min. Duration of action: 4\u20136 hr. IV administration is NOT recommended."],t.s)
