B.b2v=new A.b("Continuous infusion, IV: 2\u201310 mCg/kg loading dose (max. dose: 1 mg) over 30 min followed by infusion of 0.2\u20130.4 mCg/kg/min. May titrate in increments of 0.1\u20130.2 mCg/kg/min Q30 min depending on clinical response. Doses as high as 10 mCg/kg/min have been used. To prepare infusion: See IV infusions on page i.",!1)
