B.dSd=s(["Caps, sprinkle:","Topamax Sprinkle: 15, 25 mg","Generics: 15, 25, 50 mg","Tabs:","Topamax and generics: 25, 50, 100, 200 mg","Extended-release caps (Q24 hr dosing; see remarks):","Trokendi XR and generics: 25, 50, 100, 200 mg","Oral solution:","Eprontia: 25 mg/mL (473 mL); contains parabens and polyethylene glycol","Oral suspension: 6, 14, 20 mg/mL"],t.s)
B.bec=new A.b("Child 2\u201316 yr: Start with 1\u20133 mg/kg/dose (max. dose: 25 mg/dose) PO QHS \xd7 7 days, then increase by 1\u20133 mg/kg/24 hr increments at 1- to 2-wk intervals (divided daily dose BID) to response. Usual maintenance dose is 5\u20139 mg/kg/24 hr PO \xf7 BID; max. dose: 400 mg/24 hr",!1)
B.axV=new A.b("\u226517 yr and adult: Start with 25\u201350 mg PO QHS \xd7 7 days, then increase by 25\u201350 mg/24 hr increments at 1-wk intervals until adequate response. Doses >50 mg should be divided BID. Usual maintenance dose: 100\u2013200 mg BID. Doses above 400 mg/24 hr have not been shown to improve responses in adults with partial onset seizures.",!1)
B.dxr=s([B.bec,B.axV],t.I)
