B.beM=new A.b("<2 yr:",!0)
B.bfR=new A.b("Adjunctive therapy for partial-onset seizures (limited data): Start with 7.5\u201310 mg/kg/24 hr PO \xf7 BID; gradually increase the dose 7.5\u201310 mg/kg/24 hr every 5\u20137 days up to a max. dose of 60\u201390 mg/kg/24 hr. Daily dosage may be divided TID for improved tolerability and to achieve therapeutic levels.",!1)
