B.aRB=new A.b("Adjunctive therapy for partial-onset seizures: Start with 600 mg/24 hr PO \xf7 BID. Dose may be increased at weekly intervals, as clinically indicated, by a maximum of 600 mg/24 hr. Usual maintenance dose is 1200 mg/24 hr PO \xf7 BID. Doses \u22652400 mg/24 hr are generally not well tolerated due to CNS side effects.",!1)
