B.aBu=new A.b("Adjunctive therapy for partial-onset seizures: Start with 8\u201310 mg/kg/24 hr PO once daily up to a max. dose of 600 mg/24 hr. Then gradually increase at weekly intervals in increments of 8\u201310 mg/kg/24 hr (max. dosage increment: 600 mg) to the following maintenance doses:",!1)
