B.dCq=s(["Liquid [OTC]:","Pepto-Bismol, Bismatrol, Pink Bismuth, Stomach Relief, and others: 262 mg/15 mL (240, 360, 480 mL)","Stomach Relief Extra Strength: 525 mg/15 mL (237 mL)","Chewable tabs [OTC]: 262 mg; may contain aspartame","Contains 102 mg salicylate per 262-mg tablet; or 129 mg salicylate per 15 mL of the 262 mg/15 mL liquid"],t.s)
