B.doU=s([">3 to \u22645\xd7 ULN","Reconfirm by another aminotransferase test; if confirmed, modify dosage regimen (always reassess aminotransferase levels within 3 days and Q2 wk thereafter to any dosage reintroduction or reduction):\n3\u2013\u226412 yr, and >12 yr and \u226440 kg: Interrupt therapy. If aminotransferase returns to pretreatment levels, reintroduce with dosage prior to interruption.\n>12 yr and >40 kg, and adult: Reduce dosage to 62.5 mg PO BID; or interrupt therapy and monitor aminotransferase levels Q2 wk (if aminotransferase levels return to pretreatment levels, continue with most recent dosage or 62.5 mg PO BID)."],t.s)
