B.aXg=new A.b("Symptomatic congenital cytomegalovirus (CMV) (from pharmacokinetic [PK] data in 8 infants 4\u201390 days old [mean: 20 days] and 24 neonates 8\u201334 days old): 16 mg/kg/dose PO Q12 hr produced levels similar to IV ganciclovir 6 mg/kg/dose BID. A comparison of 6 weeks vs. 6 months of therapy in 96 neonates (>32 wk gestation and \u22651.8 kg) showed modest improvement in long-term hearing and developmental outcomes at 1\u20132 yr of age with the longer duration of therapy of 6 months.",!1)
B.cPl=s([B.aXg],t.I)
