B.dEV=s(["Injection: 125 units (1.2 mL); contains 10% maltose, 0.03% polysorbate 80, and <40 mCg/mL immunoglobulin A (IgA); preservative free. May contain low levels of anti\u2013protein S antibodies"],t.s)
