B.aLO=new A.b("Maintenance dose: 8 mg/kg/dose IV Q12 hr and convert to the oral suspension dosage form after significant clinical improvement at a dose of 9 mg/kg/dose PO Q12 hr (max. dose: 350 mg Q12 hr). The oral suspension dosage form was used in clinical trials, and the bioequivalence of this dosage form and tablets has not been evaluated in children. Dosage increments and decrements of 1-mg/kg (or 50-mg) steps have been recommended for those with inadequate response and who are unable to tolerate their dosage level, respectively.",!1)
